Package: LinearRegression
Type: Package
Title: Linear Regression via OLS Implemented with R and Rcpp
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jiamin", "Zou",
      email = "jmzou@umich.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: `LinearRegression` is an R package that implements Ordinary Least Squares (OLS) regression using both R and C++ (via **Rcpp**) for improved computational efficiency.  
    It provides lightweight and flexible functions for **model fitting**, **prediction**, 
    and **model summarization**, mirroring the functionality of R’s built‑in `lm()` function.
    This package is developed as part of **Biostat 625 Homework #4**, with the goal of 
    demonstrating how to build an R package from scratch and compare the implementation 
    against the original R base functions in terms of **correctness** (via `all.equal()`) 
    and **efficiency** (via `microbenchmark()`).
